<title>FRANCE: Rouen March 1-12 flour exports 33,963 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen March 1-12 flour exports 33,963 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 33,963 tonnes between March 1 and March 12, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 74,000 tonnes for the whole of March 1996.</p>
<p>March 1-12 exports included 3,300 tonnes for West Africa, 10,273 tonnes for Eritrea and 20,390 tonnes for Yemen, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
